        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-fabedfca6889",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Spend the day in Santa Cruz. Your tour begins at the Minor Basilica of San Lorenzo on Plaza 14 de Septiembre. Then visit Campo Arte, where local crafts are on display, and El Abasto Market. Along the way you’ll see major city landmarks and residential neighbourhoods before ending the tour with traditional coffee.\n\nPrivate transport, admission tickets and guide services in English or Spanish are included for the day. All transfers required by the itinerary are included in the tour price."
